OL,3,AEight children among 21 killed after
OL,4,Awar-damaged Gaza building collapses,
OL,5,Arescuers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 21 people have been killed,
OL,8,Fincluding eight children, and dozens
OL,9,Fare missing after a war-damaged
OL,10,Fbuilding collapsed in the Gaza Strip
OL,11,Fovernight, local rescuers and medics
OL,12,Fsay.
OL,14,FWitnesses told the BBC that the
OL,15,Fsix-storey building in the Tal al-Hawa
OL,16,Farea of Gaza City had been left tilting
OL,17,Fdangerously to one side after an
OL,18,FIsraeli strike more than a year ago.
OL,19,FDisplaced families were living inside
OL,20,Fbecause they were desperate, they said.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
